# Claude Code
.claude/

# Raw meet files — these carry minors' birthdates and must never reach a public
# repo. A stylesheet CDN has no business holding one, which is exactly why the
# rule belongs here: the repos nobody expects to receive a meet file are the ones
# where a misdirected write would go unnoticed.
*.sd3
*.SD3
*.hy3
*.HY3
*.cl2
*.CL2
*.zip
*.ZIP
